diff --git a/docs/folio-android.md b/docs/folio-android.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..3a1c4a9
--- /dev/null
+++ b/docs/folio-android.md
@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@
+# Folio Android integration
+
+2026-10-23. Local downstream fork for Folio Office 0.5.0.
+
+Folio owns document tabs, save, undo, redo and the appearance preference. The duplicate native title strip and the Account, About and community promotions are removed. Required copyright and licence notices remain in the Android distribution. Dark document colours affect only rendering; document data and exports retain their original colours.
+
+Validation: WebAssembly release build and Folio browser import/edit/export integration tests. Android APK assembly and signature verification.
+
+The primary menu row is 24 logical pixels (80% of WordCraft's previous 30), with Inter 12.5 pt and semibold selection. GridCraft and DeckCraft take the same pinned, OFL Inter family as an optional build input; model and cell fonts are unchanged.
